<section class="founder-section" id="philosophy">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="founder-grid">
      <div class="founder-media-box">
        <img src="{{ 'founder-laboratory.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Aura Botanica Founder formulating in lab">
        <div class="founder-quote-card">
          "Skin doesn't crave synthetics or aggressive chemicals; it responds to living plant actives formulated in biocompatible harmony."
          <div class="founder-quote-author">— Dr. Elena Vance, Master Herbal Formulator</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="founder-story-content">
        <span class="section-label">Behind The Formulation</span>
        <h2 class="founder-title">Formulation Without Compromise</h2>
        <p class="founder-p">
          Aura Botanica was born from a fundamental belief: that therapeutic plant chemistry can outperform conventional synthetic skincare when sourced sustainably and extracted cold.
        </p>
        <p class="founder-p">
          Every bottle originates in our dedicated botanical laboratory, using heirloom Damascus roses, hand-harvested green tea leaves, and first-press cold-pressed rosehip seed oil.
        </p>

        <div class="founder-stats-grid">
          <div>
            <div class="f-stat-num">0%</div>
            <div class="f-stat-txt">Fillers, silicones, synthetic dyes, or sulfates</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="f-stat-num">100%</div>
            <div class="f-stat-txt">Cruelty-free & sustainably cold-pressed</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="f-stat-num">7 Days</div>
            <div class="f-stat-txt">Average time to visible transformation in skin tone</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Founder Story",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
